Description: desktop for Claude Code, OpenAI Codex and OpenRouter agents
 Helios is a native GTK4/libadwaita desktop that keeps every coding-agent
 session in one window: what the agent is doing right now, what it may do,
 and what it has spent. Claude sessions drive the official claude CLI, GPT
 sessions bind to a persistent Codex App Server, and OpenRouter sessions run
 Helios's own agent loop against any model in the live catalog.
 .
 Permissions are a visible per-conversation control, every provider has a
 spend breaker, and a Work carries an objective and a definition of done
 that the model's plan can never rewrite.
 .
 The CLIs themselves are not packaged here: install and sign in to claude
 (and optionally codex) separately.
